// default power policy assigned will be activated. If an entity does not have a default power
// policy assigned, then the entity will be capped at its idle power policy if one exists.
// Otherwise, the entity will be "ping"ed if ping_hosts is set, and the result of the ping will be included in the
// return status. If ping_hosts is not set, entities with no power policies will not be pinged and they may be
// inaccessible when the topology starts.
